{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Home County</i>\u00a0is a village-building game set in an Edwardian-inspired world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Functional Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform an overgrown patch of land into a thriving village! Each villager brings unique talents to help your community flourish. Watch your gardener harvesting flowers, your blacksmith crafting, and your artisan creating goods. Keep spirits high by decorating houses and tending to their needs. The happier your villagers, the more your village prospers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Edwardian Life Sim</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your days pursuing charming hobbies like painting, fishing, or mining. Relax in authentic Edwardian style. Take a soothing bath, unwind with the radio, or indulge in a restful nap.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new era, restore the Crystal Garden, and meet charming characters. Venture into a mines filled with history, treasures, and adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a cast of 16 characters, each with their own personality, routines, and storylines. Share gifts, enjoy heartfelt conversations, and build lasting friendships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672100?t=1755676632","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672100?t=1755676632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/bfdda94625d3fc54849777df90e7162d63e740b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755676632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/bfdda94625d3fc54849777df90e7162d63e740b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755676632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Home County</i>\u00a0is a village-building game set in an Edwardian-inspired world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Functional Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform an overgrown patch of land into a thriving village! Each villager brings unique talents to help your community flourish. Watch your gardener harvesting flowers, your blacksmith crafting, and your artisan creating goods. Keep spirits high by decorating houses and tending to their needs. The happier your villagers, the more your village prospers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Edwardian Life Sim</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your days pursuing charming hobbies like painting, fishing, or mining. Relax in authentic Edwardian style. Take a soothing bath, unwind with the radio, or indulge in a restful nap.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new era, restore the Crystal Garden, and meet charming characters. Venture into a mines filled with history, treasures, and adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a cast of 16 characters, each with their own personality, routines, and storylines. Share gifts, enjoy heartfelt conversations, and build lasting friendships. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Swanworth"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672100/cd12a24bdd5507d702da8d2476101655a9d4e155/header.jpg?t=1755676632","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Processor/Ryzen 1700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185556,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185556/movie480.mp4?t=1755627106","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185556/movie_max.mp4?t=1755627106"},"name":"Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185556/1cd70e694233d758dfaecadc77bf1d9f43309f62/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755627106","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185556/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755627106","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185556/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755627106"}}],"name":"The Home County","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (Version 1903) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Processor/Ryzen 1